{{#if approved}}
  <p>
    Great news! Your checkpoint submission for
    <strong>
      {{name}}
    </strong>
    has been approved!
  </p>
  <p>
    All images you submitted for this checkpoint have been reviewed and accepted. You can continue with your program
    progress.
  </p>
{{else}}
  <p>
    Your checkpoint submission for
    <strong>
      {{name}}
    </strong>
    has been rejected.
  </p>
  <p>
    The images you submitted for this checkpoint did not meet the requirements. Please review the checkpoint
    requirements and resubmit new images that clearly demonstrate completion of this checkpoint.
  </p>
{{/if}}